      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-19T09:21:20Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(ui): the report door sends the project file name, not its path\n\nThe Report door puts the Debug info report into the GitHub new-issue\nURL. The \"Project:\" line had the full path of the project file, which\nusually holds the user name. The door now uses a shared form of the\nreport: the project and machine files by name only, and the exact\nproject path in the status line replaced by the file name. The Debug\ninfo panel in the application keeps the full paths. An unsaved project\nstill reads \"Project: unsaved\".\n\nFixes #2744\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
